<title>USA: Motor Club of America Q3 full results.</title>
<headline>Motor Club of America Q3 full results.</headline>
<dateline>PARAMUS, N.J. 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>For the Three   For the Nine</p>
<p>				     Months Ended    Months Ended</p>
<p>				     September 30,   September 30,</p>
<p>				 1996	1995	1996	 1995</p>
<p>Net Income:</p>
<p> From operations	$958,654 $386,673 $2,301,349 $1,009,963</p>
