<p> Net income		    .44	.31	  .87	  .84</p>
<p>Note: (A)  As compared to 1994, The Unsatisfied Claim and Judgment Fund (&quot;UCJF&quot;) of the State of New Jersey is a mandatory reinsurance pool which pertains to New Jersey Personal Injury Protection claims in excess of Motor Club's statutory retention limit of $75,000.</p>
<p>The premium rates assessed were 6.4 percent in 1994; 1.4 percent in 1995; and 4.5 percent in 1996.</p>
<p>Revenues for the three and nine month periods were $12,838,694 and $36,755,233, respectively, as compared to $10,185,612 and $29,201,108 in 1995.</p>
